   "line": [
    "e5"
   ],
   "spoken": "White pushes e5, trying to move-order us into a French Advance. The escape is that our light-squared bishop isn't shut in yet — we can develop it outside the pawn chain first and reach an improved French.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": [
