   "line": [
    "Bb5"
   ],
   "spoken": "White develops to b5. The capture on c6 isn't really a threat, but we'd rather not wreck our queenside pawns if we don't have to.",
   "kind": "main"
  },
  {
   "ply": 10,
   "t": 170.5,
   "fen": "r3kbnr/ppq1pppp/2n5/1BppP3/6b1/2P2N2/PP1P1PPP/RNBQK2R w KQkq - 3 6",
   "line": [
    "Qc7"
   ],
   "spoken": "So the queen to c7 — less exposed than b6, and it leans on the e5-pawn, so we're happy to recapture there if White trades on c6.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": [
    "Qc7 to recapture cleanly and hit e5"
   ]
  },
  {
